WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.397
- Oh, hey, I just blew it up in there.

00:00:01.397 --> 00:00:02.372
You might want to wait.

00:00:02.372 --> 00:00:03.162
- Okay.

00:00:03.162 --> 00:00:04.001
- Cool.

00:00:05.148 --> 00:00:07.158
(happy music)

00:00:08.066 --> 00:00:09.389
- Hey, can you drive me to the airport

00:00:09.389 --> 00:00:11.061
tomorrow morning at 5?

00:00:11.061 --> 00:00:12.192
- Yeah, whatever.

00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:12.895
- Cool.

00:00:12.895 --> 00:00:14.845
- Yo, there's some beer in
the fridge if you want some.

00:00:14.845 --> 00:00:15.635
- Cool.

00:00:15.635 --> 00:00:17.104
- Hey, I'm gonna have a girl over later.

00:00:17.104 --> 00:00:19.972
Is it cool if we use the TV?

00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:20.735
- Sure.

00:00:20.735 --> 00:00:21.445
- Cool.

00:00:21.445 --> 00:00:22.309
- Hey, I mowed the lawn

00:00:22.309 --> 00:00:23.956
'cause I knew you were too busy to.

00:00:23.956 --> 00:00:25.372
- Thanks.

00:00:25.372 --> 00:00:26.115
- No worries.

00:00:26.115 --> 00:00:28.414
- I took down all the Christmas
stuff when you were gone.

00:00:28.414 --> 00:00:29.568
- Sweet.

00:00:29.568 --> 00:00:30.275
- Cool.

00:00:30.275 --> 00:00:31.363
- Hey, I like your glasses.

00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:32.895
- Thanks. I like your shirt.

00:00:32.895 --> 00:00:33.599
- Thanks.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.426
- Hey, did you eat my burrito?

00:00:35.426 --> 00:00:37.284
- Yeah.

00:00:37.284 --> 00:00:38.904
- Thanks for being honest with me.

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:40.028
- I'll get you back.

00:00:40.028 --> 00:00:40.732
- Cool.

00:00:40.732 --> 00:00:42.677
- I haven't started the show
yet. I was waiting for you.

00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:44.629
- Oh, cool. We can start now.

00:00:44.629 --> 00:00:45.330
- Cool.

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:46.450
- How was your day?

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.447
- Fine. Yours?

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:49.774
- It was whatever.

00:00:49.774 --> 00:00:50.480
- Cool.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.580
- Did you get the same
sunglasses that I already own?

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.298
- Yeah. Is that cool?

00:00:54.298 --> 00:00:55.668
- It's fine.

00:00:55.668 --> 00:00:58.524
- Can I borrow your new
jacket for my date tonight?

00:00:58.524 --> 00:00:59.453
- It's fine.

00:00:59.453 --> 00:01:00.172
- Cool.

00:01:00.172 --> 00:01:01.333
- Hey, I just won two tickets

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:02.610
for the Superbowl on the radio.

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:03.705
Do you wanna go with me?

00:01:03.705 --> 00:01:04.422
- Hell yeah.

00:01:04.422 --> 00:01:05.128
- Cool.

00:01:05.128 --> 00:01:07.301
- Hey, are you busy right now?

00:01:07.301 --> 00:01:08.229
- No.

00:01:08.229 --> 00:01:09.460
- Cool.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.457
I just kind of wanted to
get something off my chest.

00:01:11.457 --> 00:01:14.954
- What's up?

00:01:14.954 --> 00:01:16.324
- I just blew up the bathroom,

00:01:16.324 --> 00:01:18.483
so I wouldn't go in there
for another like 25 minutes.

00:01:18.483 --> 00:01:20.758
It's bad.

00:01:20.758 --> 00:01:22.128
- Thanks.

00:01:22.128 --> 00:01:23.330
- Cool.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.906
(happy music)

